{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119953","id":3784229338,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7hjsHa","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119953","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119953.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119953.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119953","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119953/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119953/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119953/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7039d78d20622b2c7d9b11d300514150fd0239d2","number":119953,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Editor: Add support for marking properties as favorite per scene","user":{"login":"WoodWood1299","id":96357948,"node_id":"U_kgDOBb5OPA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96357948?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299","html_url":"https://github.com/WoodWood1299","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Created a new system to allow properties to be set as favorite on a specific scene. The system stores the favorites in .godot/favorite_properties_local, and is mostly based on the previously existing favorite system. The properties are keyed by scene path and class name.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"552\" height=\"240\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6666ed86-0b9b-4e7b-8ec6-030408352832\" />\r\n\r\nThe inspector now allows two new actions, \"Favorite Local Property\" and \"Unfavorite Local Property\". These actions are visible but disabled on unsaved scenes. If the scene is unsaved, the \"Favorite Local Property\" button requests that the user saves the scene first. The inspector is also able to Unfavorite All/Global/Local, with each button either removing all favorites, only the project wide favorites or only the local favorites, respectively.  If a property is both a local and a global favorite, pressing Unfavorite Local or Unfavorite Global will only remove the respective category from the property, while Unfavorite All will remove both.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"553\" height=\"313\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0616f6c8-e1a6-4168-9482-2378e8ad25d4\" />\r\n\r\nThe local favorites are also updated when a scene is either moved, renamed or removed, in order to keep the list accurate, and works with node properties, external resource properties and single-property plugins.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes godotengine/godot-proposals#14573\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe feature was tested manually. We tried analyzing the favorites across multiple scenes, renaming/moving scenes around and checking persistence after shutdown. We also created a small single property plugin, which was able to be favorited, and swapped it to a multiple property favorite, which was then unable to be favorited. We also tested the feature with a Right-To-Left language, and the new icons seemed to behave correctly.\r\n\r\nOne edge case the reviewer may want to pay attention to, is that when a scene is deleted in godot, it goes back to being an unsaved scene, instead of being outright deleted. However, creating a scene, adding local favorites, deleting it (so that it becomes unsaved again) and re-saving after causes the local favorites to be erased from the scene. We ended up leaving this as is, since the feature isn't supposed to work with unsaved scenes (as the properties are scene dependent) and the re-saved scene is technically a new scene, different from the previous ones.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","follo